<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Robonotes - My Notes</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/header.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/footer.css">
    <style>

        body {
            background-color: #000000;
            color: white;
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #2da8d2, #d93b55);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }
        
        .page-container {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 20px;
            gap: 24px;
        }
        .sidebar {
            width: 260px;
            background: #1a1a1a;
            border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 24px;
            height: fit-content;
            position: sticky;
            top: 20px;
        }
        .sidebar-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #e8e8e8;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .filter-section { margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .filter-label {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .filter-select {
            width: 100%;
            background: #252525;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            color: #e8e8e8;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-family: inherit;
            outline: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .filter-select:hover { background: #2d2d2d; border-color: #444; }
        .filter-select:focus { border-color: #2da8d2; }
        .main-content { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
        .page-header {
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        .page-title-section { flex: 1; }
        .page-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #2da8d2, #d93b55);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .page-description { color: #888; font-size: 1rem; }
        .search-box {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
            background: #1a1a1a;
            border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            color: #e8e8e8;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-family: inherit;
            outline: none;
        }
        .search-box:focus { border-color: #2da8d2; }
        .search-box::placeholder { color: #666; }
        .notes-grid { display: grid; gap: 16px; }
        .note-card {
            background: #1a1a1a;
            border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .note-card:hover { background: #1f1f1f; border-color: #333; }
        .note-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        .note-title-section { flex: 1; }
        .note-title {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #e8e8e8;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .note-course { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #888; }
        .note-type {
            background: #252525;
            color: #2da8d2;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .note-content {
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            display: -webkit-box;
            -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
            -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .note-footer {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding-top: 16px;
            border-top: 1px solid #252525;
        }
        .note-date { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #666; }
        .note-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
        .view-btn, .delete-btn {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid #444;
            color: #888;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            font-family: inherit;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .view-btn:hover { background: #2a2a2a; border-color: #2da8d2; color: #2da8d2; }
        .delete-btn:hover { background: #2a2a2a; border-color: #d93b55; color: #d93b55; }
        @media (max-width: 968px) {
            .page-container { flex-direction: column; }
            .sidebar { width: 100%; position: static; }
            .page-header { flex-direction: column; }
            .search-box { max-width: 100%; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .note-header { flex-direction: column; }
            .note-actions { width: 100%; }
            .view-btn, .delete-btn { flex: 1; }
        }

        /* Modal Styles */
#modal.hidden {
    display: none;
}

#modal {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1000;
}

.modal-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
}

.modal-content {
    position: relative;
    background: #1a1a1a;
    border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
    border-radius: 16px;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 5% auto;
    padding: 24px;
    z-index: 1001;
    max-height: 80vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
}

#modalBody {
    margin-top: 16px;
}

.modal-link {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #2da8d2;
    display: inline-block;
}

.modal-link h2 {
    font-size: 1.5 em;
}

.modal-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    color: #d93b55;
}

    </style>
</head>
<body>
    {{>header}}

    <div class="page-container">
        <aside class="sidebar">
            <h2 class="sidebar-title">Notes</h2>
            
            <div class="filter-section">
                <div class="filter-label">Filter by Course</div>
                <select class="filter-select" id="courseFilter">
                    <option value="all">All Courses</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <div class="filter-section">
                <div class="filter-label">Filter by Type</div>
                    <select class="filter-select" id="typeFilter">
                    <option value="all">All Types</option>
                    <option value="video">Video</option>
                    <option value="quiz">Quiz</option>
                    <option value="summary">Summary</option>
                    <option value="essay">Essay</option>
                </select>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <main class="main-content">
            <div class="page-header">
                <div class="page-title-section">
                    <h1 class="page-title">My Notes</h1>
                    <p class="page-description">View and manage all your notes</p>
                </div>
                <input type="text" class="search-box" placeholder="Search notes...">
            </div>

            <div class="notes-grid">
                <div class="note-card">
                    <div class="note-header">
                        <div class="note-title-section">
                            <div class="note-title">Derivatives and Chain Rule</div>
                            <div class="note-course">Calculus I</div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="note-type">video</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="note-content">Understanding how to apply the chain rule when taking derivatives of composite functions. The outer function's derivative is multiplied by the inner function's derivative...</div>
                    <div class="note-footer">
                        <div class="note-date">February 10, 2024</div>
                        <div class="note-actions">
                            <button class="delete-btn" onclick="alert('Delete note')">Delete</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="note-card">
                    <div class="note-header">
                        <div class="note-title-section">
                            <div class="note-title">Newton's Laws of Motion</div>
                            <div class="note-course">Physics 101</div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="note-type">summary</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="note-content">Three fundamental laws that describe the relationship between a body and the forces acting upon it. First law (inertia), second law (F=ma), and third law (action-reaction)...</div>
                    <div class="note-footer">
                        <div class="note-date">February 9, 2024</div>
                        <div class="note-actions">
                            <button class="delete-btn" onclick="alert('Delete note')">Delete</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="note-card">
                    <div class="note-header">
                        <div class="note-title-section">
                            <div class="note-title">Binary Search Trees</div>
                            <div class="note-course">Data Structures</div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="note-type">quiz</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="note-content">A tree data structure where each node has at most two children. Left subtree contains only nodes with values less than the parent, right subtree contains values greater than the parent...</div>
                    <div class="note-footer">
                        <div class="note-date">February 7, 2024</div>
                        <div class="note-actions">
                            <button class="delete-btn" onclick="alert('Delete note')">Delete</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>
    </div>
    <!-- Modal -->
<div id="modal" class="hidden">
    <div class="modal-overlay"></div>
    <div class="modal-content">
        <button id="closeModal" class="delete-btn">Close</button>
        <div id="modalBody"></div>
    </div>
</div>

    {{>footer}}
    <script src="../managenotes.js"></script>
</body>
</html>